{"hw":"Πλάτων","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">Πλάτων</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Πλάτων</span> <span class=\"gk\">[α]</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ωνος</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Plato</cite> (prop. a nickname, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">broad-shouldered</b>):— hence <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adj.</span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Πλατώνειος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">α</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">of Plato,</b> Sch.D.T.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">p.224</span> </span> H., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Suid.</span> </span>; <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Πλατώνεια</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">τά</span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">festival in honour of P.,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Porph.</span> </span> ap. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Eus.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">PE</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.3</span> </span>:— also <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Πλατωνικός</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ή</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">όν</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">AP</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.354.9</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Agath.</span> </span>); <span class=\"gk\">Π. φιλόσοφος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Sammelb.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6012</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(iii A.D.)</span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀποδείξεις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Dam.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">311</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Comp.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">-ώτερος</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">263</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Sup.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">-ώτατος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Luc.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">VH</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.19</span> </span>. <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-κῶς</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">after the manner of Plato,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τὰς γυναῖκας Π. ἔχοντες κοινάς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Str.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.3.7</span> </span>.</div></div><div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">πλάτων</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πλάτων</span>, bronze <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">ladle</b> for separating whey from curds, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hsch.</span> </span> </div></div>"}